female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510912003:1":{"text":"你是统帅，你应该最了解士兵们的想法！我们宁可死在战场上，曝尸荒野，也绝不做那些原始人的笑柄！哪怕只能用尸体堆成堡垒，呼临城也绝不可能沦陷！","source_cn":"你是统帅，你应该最了解士兵们的想法！我们宁可死在战场上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD41A7DBB9340EB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510912004:0":{"text":"……听着，隆尔。我相信你和士兵们的忠勇，也相信你们的能力，可是雅库伯尔的的确确得到了狩猎神的加护。","source_cn":"……听着，隆尔。我相信你和士兵们的忠勇，也相信你们的能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77C8E9BD26B2F008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510912005:0":{"text":"用凡人的力量对抗神力，纯粹是在白白送死！难道你要眼睁睁看着所有士兵全都倒下才肯停手吗！","source_cn":"用凡人的力量对抗神力，纯粹是在白白送死！难道你要眼睁睁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166D16A1DAEA17DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510912006:0":{"text":"现在，只有撤退才能保住我们的力量，等待反攻的时机。","source_cn":"现在，只有撤退才能保住我们的力量，等待反攻的时机。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56149152154C6A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510912007:0":{"text":"别危言耸听了，珀尔修斯！一旦撤退，等着我们的只有死亡！","source_cn":"别危言耸听了，珀尔修斯！一旦撤退，等着我们的只有死亡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB58930A38BF08D6","variant_status":"","male":"